  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicant has failed to provide a Parking Stress Survey (Lambeth Methodology) to demonstrate that the proposed development, which provides no additional off-street parking, would not result in an unacceptable increase in on-street parking demand. There is a requirement for on-site parking provision or robust evidence to justify a car-free approach. In the absence of such evidence, the proposal is considered to hinder the free flow of traffic and compromise highway safety, contrary to Sutton Local Plan Policies 36 and 37."
